<table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 width=95%><tr><td><table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td>
<font size=2>[214]</font> <font size=4 color=#40c0c0> 文庫のチャット</font>
</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2003/11/02 (日) 23:52:22 <strong>▽</strong> 電波妖精 </font></td>
<td nowrap align=left><font size=3>　<a href="index.cgi?res=200311020235222&log=data4">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200311020235222"></font>
</td></table>
